    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated on a prime corner site within the highly sought-after Manor Farm development, this superb three-bedroom semi-detached home offers spacious, light-filled accommodation and an exceptional outdoor setting, making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers, and those seeking a modern home in a convenient location.\r\nThe property extends to approximately 99 sq. m. (1,066 sq. ft.) and is presented in excellent condition throughout. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, guest WC, a generous front living room, and a bright open-plan kitchen/dining area with direct access to the private rear garden. \r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with en suite, together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally located within easy reach of Cork city centre, Cork University Hospital, Wilton Shopping Centre, schools, and a host of local amenities, offering an excellent balance of suburban living and city convenience.\r\n         Viewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall:\t\t 5.4 x 2.8 m\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:            \t\t4.9 x 3.2 m\r\nHardwood floor.\r\nSolid fuel stove.\r\nMarble fireplace incorporating matching hearth and hardwood surround.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room:      \t5.3 x 3.4 m\r\nExtensive floor and eye level units incorporating integrated four plate hob, extractor hood, oven, ceramic sink unit, plumbed for dishwasher.\r\nGlazed splash back.\r\nTiled floor.\r\nDouble glazed double doors to garden/patio area;\r\n\r\nDownstairs Toilet                           1.8 x 0.9 m\r\nWC & WHB\t \r\nTiled floor\r\nPartly tiled walls\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nMain Bedroom:\t\t4.0 x 3.0 m\r\nPair double built-in wardrobes inc. mirrored sliding doors.\r\nLaminated wooden floors.\r\nEn-suite:\t\t\t2.2 x 1.0 m\r\nThree-piece suite\r\nTiled walls\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  \t\t4.0 x 3.5 m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes inc. mirrored sliding doors.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t5.0 x 2.5 m\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: \t\t2.7 x 2.0 m\r\nThree-piece suite, \r\nWalls tiled floor to ceiling. \r\n \r\nOutside: \r\nOccupying a generous corner site, this home enjoys a private enclosed rear garden with a desirable west-facing aspect, perfect for outdoor entertaining and evening sunshine. The front features a cobble-lock driveway providing off-street parking, while the side vehicle access enhances practicality.\r\n\r\nWindows:  PVC double glazed windows throughout \r\nCentral Heating: Air to Water C. H.\r\nServices: All main services connected.\r\nFloor Area:  99 sq m (1,066 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nTenure:  Freehold\r\n\r\nBER:  A3 112498894"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime corner site.\r\nPrivate west-facing rear garden\r\nCobble-lock driveway with off-street parking\r\nAir to Water Central Heating.\r\nDouble-glazed PVC windows.\r\nConvenient to Cork city, CUH, UCC, MTU and the South Link Road.\r\nFloor Area c.99 sq. m / 1,765 sq. ft. \r\nFreehold"
      },
      {
